      "title": "Delta pushes nonstop Riyadh service back to March 2027",
      "summary": "The Points Guy reports Delta Air Lines has delayed the start of its nonstop service to Riyadh, Saudi Arabia, until March 2027, citing attacks at the Riyadh airport. No official confirmation was available in the fetched evidence, so details should be treated as reported. Travelers should not plan on the route launching on its previously expected timeline.",
      "verification": "reported",
      "sourcePublishedAt": "2026-10-12T18:05:06.000Z",
      "effectiveAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "publisher": "The Points Guy",
          "url": "https://thepointsguy.com/news/delta-delays-launch-riyadh-saudi-arabia-flights/",
